# Editor directories and files
**/.vscode/*
!**/.vscode/extensions.json
**/.idea
**/.DS_Store
**/*.suo
**/*.ntvs*
**/*.njsproj
**/*.sln
**/*.sw?
misc

fly.toml

frontend/.env*
backend/.env*

# Installed/built locally: the image installs and builds its own dependencies, and
# shipping these in the build context only slows the build down (and can leak a
# developer's local node_modules into the image).
frontend/node_modules
frontend/dist
backend/vendor
backend/node_modules
